oves, the HUD. This\nmodule simulates and draws the world under the game's clear canvas. Everything is drawn by code: levels written as text,\ntextures pixel by pixel, characters by the 2D engine's rigs (as cards, or as 3D p12M\t_ref","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01F96122GYERc7bFHmnqGT6G","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
