n and Xbox only), and audio gained `bus(name)` and `sfx(name, { pan })`.\n- **One change I'd make:** A grid-crawler helper in the 3D engine and a wider font character set.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** A clear target, ordered work, exact tests and hub rules, and useful data tables.\n- **Confusing:** The scale exceeds a medium-effort session, and \"cut quantity, never a system\" conflicts with it.\n- **Hardest:** Scoping to a vertical slice with every system, balanced, on a slow renderer.\n- **Would change:** Add ranked must-haves and cuts per effort level, give one full reference floor with its walkthrough, and make some engine patches optional."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2140,"cache_read_input_tokens":667135,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2140},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c69a81a-1298-4714-b95d-17fe664f547a","uuid":"f058b37a-bb8d-49d2-92a7-b50b7f4ccb68","timestamp":"2026-11-04T05:08:52.864Z","request_id":"req_011CghJvbCkPgwQkxUZ7KQyC"}
